        "Death Company — ivanklimenko, ArtStation"
      ],
      "edit": "ap-mat"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.767,
      "end": 50.933,
      "picture": "duel",
      "text": "",
      "credits": [
        "Horus and Sanguinius — 40K Gallery https://40k.gallery/horus-and-sanguinius/"
      ],
      "edit": "lui-ra"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.933,
      "end": 52.933,
      "picture": "berserk",
      "text": "Dann stürzt er sich wie von Sinnen auf den Feind, ohne Angst, ohne Halt, bis er stirbt.",
      "credits": [
        "Death Company Blood Angels — 40K Gallery https://40k.gallery/death-company-blood-angels/"
